Package: com.anlai.omnicar
Name: OmniCar
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Unlock every limit of CarPlay.
 OmniCar takes CarPlay beyond what Apple allows - more freedom, more
 features and everything you need on the road, all in one place.
 .
 Features:
  - Startup Screen: play your own video on the CarPlay screen every time
    you connect - add clips from Photos or Files, choose the duration, Fill
    or Fit, sound through the car speakers, tap to skip
  - Speed Bubble: a floating bubble with your current speed and the posted
    limit from Vietmap Live or GOFA while the app runs in the background - on
    the CarPlay screen, or on iPhone when no car is connected; 18 styles,
    drag, pinch, tap to reopen the app
  - Split Screen: two or three CarPlay apps side by side on the car screen,
    each with its real CarPlay interface - 2 boxes, 3 boxes or 1 large + 2,
    drag the divider to resize, swap boxes, a floating window, three
    favorite layouts, reopen the last split on connect, and Siri /
    Shortcuts through the omnicar:// URL scheme
  - App Bridge: iPhone apps with no CarPlay interface, such as YouTube,
    TikTok or Netflix, on the car screen, hosted by OmniCar itself with no
    CarBridge needed - as a Split Screen box or full screen, resized live;
    apps run in iPad mode on the car, and the bundled "Web" app shows any
    site with its desktop layout (YouTube on the big screen like on a PC)
  - More CarPlay upgrades are on the way
 .
 Every feature has its own switch and settings page under Settings > OmniCar.
 Changes apply the next time CarPlay connects; respring once after installing.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
 Replaces the standalone CarSplash, CarSpeed and CarDuo tweaks.
Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/PreferenceBundles/OmniCarPrefs.bundle/PackageIcon.png
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: carsplash-rootless, carspeed, com.anlai97.speedpop, com.anlai97.carduo, com.anpham.splitcarplay
Replaces: carsplash-rootless, carspeed, com.anlai97.speedpop, com.anlai97.carduo, com.anpham.splitcarplay
